      "visibleDestination": {
        "description": "Catalog admin model API commands stay on the operator surface and return command-owned id/version/status plus the committed aggregate snapshot; bulk preview returns the computed preview snapshot and bulk confirm returns the durable authoring job snapshot without waiting on admin detail/list projections."
